<title>USA: IBM indicated to fall sharply on NYSE.</title>
<headline>IBM indicated to fall sharply on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The open of trade in International Business Machines Corp stock on the New York Stock Exchange was delayed Wednesday due to an order imbalance, and the shares were indicated to open between 156 and 159 once the imbalance is corrected, the NYSE said.</p>
<p>The indicated range was substantially below IBM's 169-3/8 final NYSE trade last night.</p>
</text>
